SUMMARY:Community Care Night: Winter Witch Drink & Draw with RVA Krampusnacht | 18+
LOCATION:Gallery5\, 200 West Marshall Street\, Richmond\, VA 23220
DESCRIPTION:RVA Drink & Draw live costumed model drawing hosted by Brit Austin Art. Model Catleesi appears as Frau Perchta\, the winter witch. Supplies provided and a bar is on site. Doors at 7 PM.\\n\\nCost: Free (suggested donation $5-10)\\n\\nRegister: https://gallery5arts.org/calendar/community-care-night-winter-witch-drink-draw-with-rva-krampusnacht
URL:https://gallery5arts.org/calendar/community-care-night-winter-witch-drink-draw-with-rva-krampusnacht
END:VEVENT
